 # orders-svc
 Order intake for the shop. Python 3.11. Run tests with `pytest`.
 See docs/ for the runbook and partner integrations.
+
+`Order.currency` defaults to `CNY`; pass `currency="EUR"` for euro orders.
+`amount_cents` is always an integer in the order's currency's minor units.
+`daily_revenue(orders)` totals CNY orders; use
+`daily_revenue(orders, currency="EUR")` for EUR totals. No conversion is applied.
+See the runbook for deployment and the partner guide before routing EUR orders.
